WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.350
Well, let's get crackin'.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.580
Let's-a-go.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.920
Stop messing around and start!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.340
Okay.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:37.840
Who can solve this one?

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:39.300
Shiraishi.

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.800
You just called on me!

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.640
Really?

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.640
Then Izumi.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.350
Izumi?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.540
No, I wasn't asleep.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.050
I didn't say anything yet.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.740
I forgot my English textbook!

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.700
Why don't you go borrow Kagami's?

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.740
They already had English, right?

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:05.990
Honestly...

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.160
You're so careless.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.750
Thank you!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.870
You should double-check everything the day before.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.590
Tsukasa tends to forget stuff a lot, right?

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.710
Come to think of it...

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.830
...Konata doesn't forget stuff like textbooks much.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:24.220
That's because I'm surprisingly
diligent about those things.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:27.560
Plus, I never take my textbooks home in the first place.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.180
Oh, yeah...

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.810
That's not called being diligent.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.150
But you can't review what we went over
in class without a textbook.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.690
I never study at home.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.690
Since you end up cramming the night before...

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:44.240
But Kona-chan's good at putting
off stuff till the night before.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.000
That could be why I forget to do my homework.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.620
You don't forget to do it.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.160
You just don't want to do it.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.790
So show me your homework
for Japanese this afternoon.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:57.670
Already at it again, huh?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.800
I've been thinking...

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.300
Miyuki's in your class...

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.090
Ask her to show you her homework.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.220
How should I put this...

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.840
Miyuki-san's such a nice person...

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.930
...that it ends up being hard to ask her for anything...

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.390
You know what I mean?

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.050
There's this sensation you get.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.890
I get what you're saying...

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:16.440
...but I still can't accept it.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.370
Izumi.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.110
What? She's late?

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:23.150
Stop!

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:24.950
I'm not late!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.780
I was late because I had to help someone!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.740
I usually go around with this guy...

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.290
...but I just couldn't get away today!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.790
He was like it's okay, we can split up...

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.540
...but the other five of us had gotten one...

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.290
...and he was the odd one out...

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.130
...which kinda left a bad feeling.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:46.430
When you've been in the same party for a
long time, you wanna help each other out.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:48.260
So we all backed him up.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.470
Yeah, friends are a beautiful thing.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.970
Really...

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.730
So you were up all night playing online games again.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.230
Kept playing after I logged off, huh?

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.900
Izumi.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.690
What? She's late?

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:04.650
Stop!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.360
I'm not late!

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:09.410
This girl crashed into me in the shopping district.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.370
Then she suddenly grabbed
my hand and took off running.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.250
Eventually, I learned that she'd stolen some taiyaki...

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.620
...and was on the run...

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.750
I was wondering what any of this had to do with me...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:23.420
...but I had no choice but to duck into
a café to hide from the taiyaki baker.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.470
<i>So many potential comebacks...</i>

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.470
<i>But I can't!</i>

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.260
<i>As a teacher!</i>

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:30.390
<i>As a human being!</i>

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.390
I'm down with a summer cold.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:35.480
Izumi.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.890
What's wrong?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.150
Teacher, I'm terribly sorry...

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.360
...but I need to take a sick day...

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:42.690
Hey, now.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.440
Too much gaming again?

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:47.210
The same trick won't work every time.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.280
No, I'm sick...

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.700
Let me guess. You've got a summer cold, right?

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.160
Winter's over and the weather's nice...

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.740
...so stop being lazy and get to class!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.720
So she totally treated me like
the boy who cried wolf yesterday.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.800
You reap what you sow.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.090
Are you okay now?

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:13.760
It looks like my fever broke...

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.390
...but my throat still hurts.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.140
That means you breathe through your mouth.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:21.350
Huh?

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:22.480
Well...

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.480
You can also breathe through your mouth...

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.940
...but wouldn't you usually
breathe through your nose?

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:26.820
No...

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.150
But Kona-chan breathes through
her mouth more than her nose.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:31.910
Because...

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:32.320
You know?

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.740
If a virus enters through your mouth,
you get a throat infection.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:39.000
And if a virus enters through your nose,
you get a nasal infection.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:44.090
So people with sore throats probably had a higher chance of a virus entering through their throat...

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.760
This is when we turn to Miyuki-san.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.590
Yeah...

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:50.510
Huh?

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:54.140
So hot...

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.140
Don't feel like doing anything...

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.350
Kagami?

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.730
About your birthday party today...

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.600
How about we hold it at my place?

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.360
It's so hot that I can't move a step.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.600
We're baking cookies right now.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:12.820
I'll go.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.660
Hurry it up.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.030
Welcome!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.990
Happy birthday!

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.290
Tsukasa and other.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.290
Don't abbreviate me off!

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.290
Happy birthday.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:25.040
Kagami-san and Tsukasa-san.

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:27.920
Thanks!

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.920
Thank you!

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.380
And it isn't much...

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:33.470
...but I have presents for you.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:34.760
I'm so excited!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.220
Open it up.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.060
Matching earrings!

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.810
I considered a number of options...

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.400
...but I had a hard time making up my mind.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.150
And here are presents from me!

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:49.150
Oh, joy.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.150
Open it up.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:54.400
What is this?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.990
Brigade chief armband.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.240
Try it on.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.180
Why should I put this on?!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:04.500
I figured it would fit you perfectly.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.630
It'll go better on you.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:06.880
Um...

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.380
Then what is this...

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.630
To Heart?!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.920
It cost a fortune...

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.520
Wear it with care.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.430
Don't try to make both of us cosplay!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.220
It's barely any different from our uniform.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.810
That's quite a problem.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.770
If it's too big...

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:23.730
Right?

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:24.640
Just sucks.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.200
And it stinks.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.230
Hey.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.610
It's our birthday.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.410
You could hold back a little.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:35.080
Tsukasa's cookies are always so good.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.350
I baked them with her this time.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.350
Kinda learned as I went.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:42.790
What's wrong?

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.500
Having heard that...

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.210
...some of these cookies
don't taste that good anymore.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.330
Weird, ain't it?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.700
What was that?!

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.920
Wonder if this is one of Kagami's.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:54.800
Might as well eat the cake, too.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.800
Kagamin. Only labors industriously on her birthday.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.550
Zip it.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.430
By the way...

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.480
...isn't there always a fight over how to cut the cake?

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.350
Why?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.400
You know.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.360
When you cut a cake into a bunch of slices...

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.820
...how do you divide up the strawberries on top...

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:14.030
...or decide who gets the chocolate decorations?

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.700
My older sisters all love chocolate.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.580
Rats...

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:21.990
I was off.

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.290
Wouldn't expect that from Kagamin.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.540
What are you talking about?!

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.420
Let's eat!

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.790
Let's eat.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:38.520
What?

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.760
<i>My strawberry's awfully small.</i>

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.020
What is it?

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:50.060
Do I have cake on my face?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:53.980
I just discovered another facet of Kagamin's charm.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.650
You sound just like Shin-chan so stop it.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:59.360
It's almost summer break.

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.030
That's right.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.490
The beach, the pool, and summer festivals...

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:05.290
Are there any other usual events?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.120
Twitch.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.710
Summer is all about the annual celebration!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.290
The beginning of the battle!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.380
The one and only...

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.590
Comiket!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.630
No, no, no, no, no.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.050
That only applies to you.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.130
Is that like cricket?

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.550
W-Well...

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.340
Everyone has their own different thing to do.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.720
Like visiting relatives or something.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.170
Good morning.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.600
Miyuki...

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.760
...do you have some kind of regular summer activity?

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.890
Let's see...

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:36.150
I'll be taking a vacation overseas again this year.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:37.820
Again?

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:38.740
She said again?

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.030
Stupid bourgeois!

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.200
Is that like yogurt?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.950
You said that you started working at a costume café...

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.660
Don't you need a good figure to pull that off?

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:49.910
Man...

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:53.210
I've been lamenting my lack of a chest for a while...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.540
...but then this game said...

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.710
"A flat chest is a status symbol!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:58.300
A rarity!"

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.420
Word for word.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.260
And when you think about it...

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.800
...there is a demand, right?

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.510
Which means I'm valuable!

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:10.310
<i>I want to know how a line from
a game can fill her with confidence.</i>

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.270
Then I guess I'm okay, too.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.270
Honestly...

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.020
We have a test coming up.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.550
Should you be gaming so much?

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.650
If you would only use some
of that passion for studying.

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:24.360
Your grades would probably go up.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.490
<i>If she's so easily influenced...</i>

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:32.450
<i>...wouldn't she become a genius if
someone released a game that promoted studying?</i>

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.960
<i>There's already stuff like Moe Drill.</i>

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.130
Wazzup?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.460
There's been a lot of youth crime lately.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.010
Whenever that happens...

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.510
...all the neighbors say...

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.090
He was such a nice boy.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.970
I never would have imagined
that he could do such a thing.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:48.930
Well...

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:53.260
That just means you can't
judge a person on the surface.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.980
If you ever commit a crime...

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:00.400
I always figured she would do something like this.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.680
I'll tell the whole world.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.320
Tired...

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.660
It's so hot that I don't feel like doing anything.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:15.040
I really understand how you feel...

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:19.500
...but you never feel like doing anything.

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:33.230
Hello, Kagami.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:34.310
Yo.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.020
Making progress on your studying for the test?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.870
I was tidying up my room.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:45.070
You know how kinda get the urge to start
cleaning when you're feeling the pressure?

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.160
I can understand...

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.280
...but study.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:48.780
Okay!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.800
Let's get a little studying done today!

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.960
I'll take a thirty minute break.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.790
I'm losing my concentration.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:07.890
Time's already up.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:10.760
Just thirty more minutes.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.350
Thirty more minutes...

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:22.180
Isn't Haruhi about to start?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:29.280
<i>They definitely cut corners with
those long-winded Nagato scenes.</i>

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:33.540
<i>That Ya***** hasn't been very impressive recently.</i>

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.210
They're already flaming away.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:43.920
It's already two?

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.010
Not going to happen today.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.650
I'll go to sleep and wake up early to study.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.260
If I wake up at five...

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:54.930
...I can sleep three hours.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:15.950
I ended up killing time yesterday by
reading manga and watching anime.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.750
Sounds like something you would do.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:18.960
Come to think of it...

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.670
You sure have some odd taste in manga and games.

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.250
You read manga aimed at boys...

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.710
...and mainly play dating sims for men.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.470
My dad reads manga and plays games a lot...

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.680
...so I was probably influenced.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.890
I've been watching him from the side since I was little.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.350
<i>I can understand the manga...</i>

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:39.020
<i>...but playing dating sims in front of your daughter?</i>

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.810
<i>What kind of father is he?</i>

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.310
Doesn't your mom have anything to say...

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:46.010
...with both of you like this?

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.130
I don't have a mom.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.360
She died when I was really little.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.580
Really...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.410
So I'm always doing housework...

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.620
...which is why I'm way better than Kagami is.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.500
Don't say stuff like that...

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.080
...when the mood isn't right for comebacks.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.670
Tsukasa's also good at cooking, right?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.130
I'm not sure if I would say that I'm good...

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:08.920
...but I love it!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.630
I wonder how good Miyuki-san is.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:12.930
She looks rich...

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.140
...so maybe she's bad at housework.

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.600
Cooking, is it?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.310
To be honest...

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:22.100
I only help out from time to time...

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.230
...so I'm not very skilled at housework.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:26.730
It's quite embarrassing.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:27.980
Oh! Knew it!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.240
But Miyuki's so good at everything else...

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:32.860
...that it doesn't really feel the same.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:36.490
You can't just assume that
she's bad when she says she's bad.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.040
I see...

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.500
No, not at all...

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.770
Then what about our teacher?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.420
I heard that she lives by herself...

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.880
...but she looks like she could be a slob.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.710
These days...

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:52.760
...ya can get by without knowing how ta cook!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.050
Ya got your convenience stores.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.180
Just kiddin'!

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.760
I can cook.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.060
About as well as your average person.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.060
<i>Please don't make jokes that sound like they're true.</i>

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.730
Tsukasa still has my dictionary.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.110
Tsukasa.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.070
Sorry. Could I get my dictionary back?

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.160
I-I was doing a little cleaning for a change of pace...

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:19.870
...yeah...

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.910
You too, huh?

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.580
Yo.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.000
What's up?

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:30.050
The people at work are trying to
come up with a new menu for summer.

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.380
So you do stuff like that, too...

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.420
And wait, did you give up on studying for the test?

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.390
Spicy stuff's good when it's hot outside...

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.350
...so how about super spicy ramen?!

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:43.730
Go with something you would usually find in a café.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.020
Then a super spicy parfait!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:49.690
Could you stop skipping the
thinking process when you respond?

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.820
I can't stand...

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.370
Why doesn't our school have swimming class?

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.120
We have a pool...

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:08.000
I'm actually relieved by that fact.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:09.710
Why's that?

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.210
To be honest...

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:13.550
I can't open my eyes underwater...

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.660
...so I can't really swim.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.220
It's quite embarrassing.

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:20.260
<i>Why are your weaknesses always anything but?!</i>

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.310
The summer Comp Festival is finally about to begin!

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:28.980
That's right...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.380
This is why I started working...

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.690
A festival...

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:37.110
You bring so many fond memories!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.570
Why are you pulling out an ancient reference?

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:40.700
Man...

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.620
When the customers start getting excited with you...

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:47.250
...doesn't it feel like everyone's
pumped up together for the festival?

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:51.170
<i>Use some of that passion on academic endeavors.</i>

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.550
<i>Having trouble getting to sleep.</i>

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:01.210
<i>Guess I'll read until I fall asleep.</i>

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.010
<i>I happen to have some stuff I just bought.</i>

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.780
So much for falling asleep...

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.250
It's already morning.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.160
And now...

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.490
...I'm feeling really sleepy...

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.250
Stare...

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:30.580
I can understand turning off
your phones around priority seats...

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.540
Because of pacemakers and the like.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.510
But why do they ban cell phone
use for the whole train?

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:38.470
Because...

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.760
...you'll disturb other people when you talk?

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:43.470
But you know...

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:47.810
Aren't trains already noisy
with people talking anyway?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.810
That includes men and women of all ages.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.850
I guess that's true...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:57.190
Are you going to work at the temple
for summer festivals like for New Year's?

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.110
Nah.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.620
I don't work in the summer.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.280
Oh, yeah...

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.160
It's getting to be that time of year.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:06.240
Huh?

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.320
Weren't you on a diet?

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.330
Nah.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.640
Maybe it's because of all the studying...

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.420
When I weighed myself yesterday, it was down.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:16.750
So I figured it'd be okay.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:17.630
That was quick.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.010
And like, you're weak.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.550
Good morning!

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:23.740
Kona-chan, good morning!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.050
Huh?

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.560
What's wrong with Kagami?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.720
Konata!

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.940
My weight already...

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.230
...went all the way up in like the blink of an eye...

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:35.810
It's 'cause you let go and started snacking again.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:37.360
And wasn't that a senryu?

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.360
I only...

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.320
I only ate a little...

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:48.740
It's not like a kilo or two more or
less is going to affect how you look.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:52.290
Why do you get so excited
and depressed over every kilogram?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.290
This is why women are hopeless.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.920
Aren't you supposed to be a woman?

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.430
Good lucky!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.890
Welcome to another episode of Lucky Channel.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:13.020
Has everyone been doing well?

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:17.110
I'm Akira Kogami, always running at 120%!

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:17.520
Today...

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:18.270
Nyoron!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:18.900
Just kidding!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.110
I'm the assistant, Minoru Shiraishi.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:23.210
Hey.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:23.990
What?

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.440
Don't interrupt me!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:27.780
I'm sorry!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.240
This isn't a kiddy ride.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.620
Learn the job already.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.620
Do you want to be dropped from this role?

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:34.920
I'm terribly sorry!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:35.370
I'll work hard!

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:37.960
Give it my all!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.040
Okay!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.130
Today...

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.250
Ta-da!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:45.170
We have big news for everyone!

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.640
Published in the November issue of Comptiq...

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.880
Project Fashionable Akira!

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:54.140
I've already received this many
postcards from everyone!

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:54.810
Uh.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:59.040
I think there was another
person involved in that project...

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.690
Thanks for all the feedback!

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.360
Like cowabunga!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:06.700
I don't think anyone's going to
understand a joke from the eighties...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:11.790
Then I'll reveal the idea
I've selected after extensive review.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:12.490
Like this.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:13.580
Um...

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.830
This is from a Miss Cherry in Satte, Saitama.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.650
Project Fashionable Akira!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.760
Kagami-san's pigtails look great on her.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.630
What if Akira-san also wore pigtails?

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:27.840
Pigtails, huh...

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:28.460
Sounds—

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.300
Wonderful!

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:31.930
That's right.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.810
Hair styling is a woman's life!

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:35.310
If I split it in two...

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:38.690
...it might look lovely...

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.060
No ifs or buts about it.

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.280
Isn't it impossible with your hair length...

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.440
But you know.

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.700
It's not like long hair is always a good thing.

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:47.490
Akira-sama.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:48.280
It's gonna show.
It's not like long hair is always a good thing.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:48.950
It weighs a lot...

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.070
It's really gonna show.

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:50.410
Like if you just twitch!
It weighs a lot...

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.990
It's a pain to maintain.
Like if you just twitch!

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:55.500
And frankly, it isn't in fashion right now.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.210
Guys run their mouth off about
liking long hair on women...

00:20:58.210 --> 00:20:58.500
Uh.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:58.960
...but do they have any idea how much
time, effort, and money it takes to maintain?

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.040
You're talking about yourself now.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:01.630
Uh...

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:03.500
You're not in character anymore.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:03.550
You're no longer Akira-sama.
...but do they have any idea how much
time, effort, and money it takes to maintain?

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:04.670
And nobody ever notices your efforts...
You're no longer Akira-sama.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:05.630
Are you listening?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:06.420
Hello?

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:07.090
And nobody ever notices your efforts...

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.180
It's already time to say goodbye!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:14.350
As for what would Akira look like with pigtails...

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:18.350
You can find out more on our
homepage or the radio show!

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:19.690
Hope to see you!

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.150
Both hands will be waiting!

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:22.480
I made a funny!

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.980
Then please look
forward to next week.

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:27.840
What was with the attitude?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:28.950
By attitude, you mean...

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.990
Why did you keep cutting in?

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:33.410
That upset about getting burned in the beginning?

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:34.450
No! Just that...

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.830
...I just figured nobody would recognize cowabunga now...

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:39.460
Ah, no.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:39.830
Forgive me.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:40.080
Uh...

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.370
Why don't we start over again?

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:42.080
You know?

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:42.580
Yes.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.420
I heard they're holding an audition for Minoru Shiraishi.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.210
Seriously?!

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:46.000
This is the first I've heard about it!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:46.960
You can try out if you want.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:47.550
Try out? Me?

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:48.470
Good for you.

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:50.130
But I'm actually him!

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:52.130
What?

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:57.060
You're amazing, Kona-chan!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.680
You can sing anything!

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.640
As long as it's an anime song.

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:02.690
You can sing well...

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.440
...in many different voices.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:07.440
Singing anime songs...

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.400
...is all about staying true to the original song.

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:11.700
Okay.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:12.990
Guess I'll sing.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:14.780
What are you gonna sing, Sis?

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:16.740
The title was displayed earlier...

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:18.160
...but I didn't recognize it.

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:20.580
Miyuki, you don't know this?

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:23.330
Guess you aren't any better.

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:29.590
I've heard this before!

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:32.050
Weren't you watching the series with me a while ago?

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:33.640
Really?

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:35.720
I still prefer the movie.

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:37.510
Are you an old geezer or something?

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:47.650
You're good.

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:51.070
Sis is the best singer out of us sisters.

00:23:24.850 --> 00:23:27.110
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.270
I'm Miyuki.

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:29.690
Golden Week...

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:33.780
...was apparently derived from industry lingo...

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:36.240
...for the period when movie
ticket sales are extremely high.

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:36.910
Next time:

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:38.160
Ace Shooter.

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:39.950
Look forward to next time!
